## Key Concepts
- DP with extra dimension for turns
- Path reconstruction and backtracking
- Time/space trade-offs with per-cell state

## Code Example
```javascript
function maxProfitGrid(grid, P){
  const m = grid.length, n = grid[0].length;
  const NEG = -1e15;
  // dp[i][j][t][dir] -> best sum
  const dp = Array.from({length:m}, ()=>
    Array.from({length:n}, ()=>
      Array.from({length:P+1}, ()=>[NEG, NEG])));
  dp[0][0][0][0] = grid[0][0];
  dp[0][0][0][1] = grid[0][0];
  // transitions omitted for brevity
  return {max: NEG, path: []};
}
```

